---
import BaseHead from '../../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import FooterScripts from '../../../components/FooterScripts.astro';
import SrkrHeader from '../../../components/SrkrHeader.astro';
import SrkrFooter from '../../../components/SrkrFooter.astro';
import OffCanvas from '../../../components/OffCanvas.astro';
import DeptNav from '../../../components/DeptNav.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="Department of Electrical & Electronics Engineering | SRKR Engineering College" description="Department of Electrical & Electronics Engineering at SRKR Engineering College, Bhimavaram — established 1980, NBA accredited, offering B.Tech EEE and M.Tech Power Systems." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <SrkrHeader />

    <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
    <section class="rts-breadcrumb breadcrumb-height breadcumb-bg" style="background-image: url(/assets/images/faculty/eee/eeehome.jpeg);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="breadcrumb-content">
              <ul class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/departments">Departments</a></li>
              </ul>
              <h1 class="section-title">Department of Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering</h1>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- BREADCRUMB AREA END -->

    <!-- content -->
    <div class="rts-faculty-details py-5">
      <div class="container">

        <DeptNav dept="eee" current="Home" />

        <!-- About the Department -->
        <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-md-center mb-5 pb-5">
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="faculty-content-text me-5">
              <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-5">About the Department</h3>

              
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering (EEE), established in 1994, is a distinguished center for education, research, and innovation in electrical engineering. The department offers B.Tech in EEE and M.Tech in Power Systems and Automation, supported by experienced faculty, modern laboratories, and advanced infrastructure. Accredited three times by the NBA and recognized as a research center by Andhra University and JNTUK, the department emphasizes academic excellence and industry-oriented learning.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The department actively promotes research and skill development in Power Systems, Renewable Energy, Electric Vehicles, Automation, and Power Electronics through funded projects and industry collaborations. State-of-the-art laboratories in Solar Energy, Robotics, Smart Systems, and E-Mobility provide hands-on experience to students. Students participate in national innovation competitions and internships at reputed organizations, while graduates secure placements in leading public sector organizations, industries, and multinational companies.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zWHp1cRW8fc?html5=1&enablejsapi=1"
                title="SRKR Department Video"
                loading="lazy"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Message from HoD -->
        <div class="row mt--30">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Message from Head of the Department</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-8">
            <div class="faculty-image text-center">
              {/* TODO: replace with real HoD photograph at /assets/images/faculty/eee/hod.jpg */}
              <img class="img-fluid mw-100" src="/assets/images/faculty/eee/221.jpg" alt="Dr. B. Ravi Kumar Varma">
              <div class="h5 mb-2 mt-5">Dr. B. Ravi Kumar Varma</div>
              <span>Professor &amp; Head of the Department</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="faculty-content-text ms-lg-5 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Welcome to the Department of Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering is dedicated to producing competent engineers with strong technical expertise, professional ethics, and leadership qualities. The department provides a solid foundation in core areas such as Electrical Circuits, Power Systems, Control Systems, Electrical Machines, and Power Electronics, while promoting innovation and lifelong learning. Students gain practical exposure through modern laboratories, internships, workshops, certification courses, and project-based learning. The curriculum also covers emerging technologies including Industrial Automation, Robotics, Electric Vehicles, Renewable Energy, Smart Grids, and Energy Storage Systems. The department encourages research, industry collaboration, and entrepreneurship to prepare students as future-ready engineers for sustainable technological development.</p>
              
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-top my-60 my_sm--10"></div>

          <!-- Mission & Vision -->
          <div class="row g-4 align-items-start justify-content-md-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 rts-scholarship-description">
              <div class="faculty-content-text si__list h-100">
                <h4 class="font-32 mb-3 mt-4">Vision</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list mb-0">
                  <li class="mb-3">To become a centre of excellence in electrical engineering that fosters learning, research and innovation with social relevance.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 rts-scholarship-description">
              <div class="faculty-content-text si__list h-100">
                <h4 class="font-32 mb-4">Mission</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list">
                  <li class="mb-3">To build an environment that cultivates employability skills with human values and ethics.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To establish collaborative interaction with industry for laboratory development, research and innovation.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To create an ambience that encourages active participation of students and staff in the pursuits towards excellence.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Specializations -->
        <div class="row g-5 faculty-sub-details rts-section-padding pt_sm--40">
          <div class="rts-section mb-4 text-center">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Core Specializations</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/placeholder/photo-1473341304170-971dccb5ac1e_600x380.jpg" alt="Power Systems" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/">Power Systems</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/placeholder/photo-1581094794329-c8112a89af12_600x380.jpg" alt="Power Electronics" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/">Power Electronics &amp; Drives</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/placeholder/photo-1466611653911-95081537e5b7_600x380.jpg" alt="Renewable Energy" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/">Renewable Energy</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/placeholder/photo-1565043666747-69f6646db940_600x380.jpg" alt="Control Systems" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/">Electric  Vehicles</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Academics & Programs -->
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center g-0">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60 text-center pt_sm--40">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Academics &amp; Programs</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Undergraduate</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/academic-programs/" class="link__list">B.Tech Electrical &amp; Electronics Engg
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/academic-programs/" class="link__list">4-Year JNTUK Affiliated
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/academic-programs/" class="link__list">NBA Accredited
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/academic-programs/" class="link__list">Industry-Aligned Curriculum
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item v__2">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Postgraduate</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/academic-programs/" class="link__list">M.Tech EVT
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                  <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/academic-programs/" class="link__list">M.Tech PSA
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/academic-programs/" class="link__list">2-Year JNTUK Affiliated
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
             
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Research</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">Ph.D. Programs (JNTUK)
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">Renewable Energy Research lab
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">E-Mobility research center
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/eee/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">Funded Projects &amp; Patents
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- content end -->

    <!-- Department Highlights -->
    <div class="rts-blog v_1 rts__light rts-section-padding">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center">
          <div class="col-md-11 col-lg-12">
            <div class="rts-section rts-border-bottom-1 mb--50 pb--20">
              <h2 class="rts-section-title text-uppercase">Department Highlights</h2>
              <p class="rts-section-description">Four decades of excellence in electrical engineering education, research, and industry collaboration.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center">
          <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-11">
            <div class="card shadow-sm p-4" style="border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee; background: #fff;">
              <div class="card-body">
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;">
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering has been accredited four times by NBA for its UG programme (2007, 2013, 2020 &amp; 2023).</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The department has been recognized as a Research Centre by JNTU Kakinada since 2017.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The department has established skill-oriented laboratories in Solar Energy Systems, Smart Systems, and Electric Vehicles.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The department is actively associated with industries through MoUs with MSME Technology Centre, BOSON Motors, HALA Mobility, Finch Power Ltd., and NRGx Renewables Pvt. Ltd.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The department operates a PMKVY 4.0 Skill Hub and has provided solar systems skill training to 60 youngsters.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The department has a strong internship ecosystem with students trained in APTRANSCO, APGENCO, Indian Railways, and other organizations.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-0 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The Department is supported by distinguished alumni serving in organizations such as NVIDIA, Vestas, PwC, IIT Guwahati, Indian Railways, and leading global industries.</span>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Department Highlights end -->

    <SrkrFooter />
    <OffCanvas />
    <FooterScripts />

    <style>
      /* Equal-height specialization cards */
      .civil-spec-card {
        height: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .civil-spec-thumb {
        height: 220px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .civil-spec-thumb img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
